        "original_id": "87a39591-ccc8-5784-90e8-d04721872135",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: DC Comics, Fawcett Comics\n- People: Otto Binder, C. C. Beck\n- Products: Black Adam, The Marvel Family, Shazam!, Captain Marvel/Marvel Family stories\n\nFacts:\n- DC Comics, Inc. is an American comic book publisher.\n- In 1945, Otto Binder and C. C. Beck created Black Adam as a one-shot villain for the first issue of Fawcett Comics' The Marvel Family comic book.\n- After DC Comics first licensed and then acquired the Fawcett characters, DC Comics revived Black Adam as a recurring character and published Captain Marvel/Marvel Family stories under the title Shazam!.",
